        "id": 1605027
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-06T21:31:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we always want string lists to be unique?\n\nIf so, is this something that should be done preprocessing vs. postprocessing?\nSince Value is a public field, callers can still add values to it after construction, and thus there may be duplicates later.",
      "revId": "50acbd5b40602eacad36b58efa74ca73cd638275",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
