      "writtenOn": "2021-04-06T22:01:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, if we want the strings to be unique then it is probably safer to make things unique as a final step. But I added the comment because the equivalent MakeLabelListAttribute function does make things unique in the constructor",
